Why This Market Matters
Pycnogenol is a patented natural extract derived primarily from the bark of the French maritime pine tree and contains procyanidins, bioflavonoids, and organic acids. The ingredient is used across dietary supplements, medicine, and personal-care products. Increasing interest in natural actives, high-purity formulations, and evidence-backed ingredients is supporting opportunities across multiple end-use categories.

